# NativeWind Styling Guidelines

## Design Philosophy
**Theme:** "Fresh Growth & Healing" (Matcha Latte)

일본의 다도(Tea Ceremony)에서 영감을 받은 차분한 말차색과 따뜻한 흙색을 사용하여, 학습의 스트레스를 줄이고 긍정적인 성장의 느낌을 줍니다.

---

## Color Tokens (Tailwind Config)

```javascript
// tailwind.config.js
module.exports = {
  theme: {
    extend: {
      colors: {
        // Brand Colors - Matcha Green
        brand: {
          DEFAULT: '#7AA06E', // Matcha Green - Primary Action / Success
          light: '#EFF5ED',   // Matcha Milk - Backgrounds / Secondary Buttons
          dark: '#56744C',    // Deep Matcha - Active States
        },
        
        // Background Colors
        'bg-canvas': '#FAFAF8',  // Off-White / Rice Paper - Main App Background
        'bg-surface': '#FFFFFF', // Pure White - Card Background
        
        // Text Colors
        'text-main': '#4B4036',  // Earth Brown / Coffee - Main Text (softer than black)
        'text-sub': '#8C857B',   // Latte Beige - Sub Text / Hints
        
        // Accent & Semantic
        accent: '#EBCD78',       // Yuzu Yellow / Honey - Highlights / Badges
        error: '#D97D7D',        // Azuki Red - Error / Alert
      },
    },
  },
};
```

### Color Usage Quick Reference
| Token | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| `brand` | #7AA06E | Primary buttons, success states, icons |
| `brand-light` | #EFF5ED | Secondary buttons, input backgrounds |
| `brand-dark` | #56744C | Active/pressed states, emphasis |
| `bg-canvas` | #FAFAF8 | Main app background |
| `bg-surface` | #FFFFFF | Cards, modals, sheets |
| `text-main` | #4B4036 | Body text, headings |
| `text-sub` | #8C857B | Captions, metadata, hints |
| `accent` | #EBCD78 | Badges, highlights, achievements |
| `error` | #D97D7D | Error messages, destructive actions |

