## Typography Strategy

### Font Family
- **Korean:** `Pretendard`
- **Japanese:** `Noto Sans JP`
- **Style:** Round & Friendly

### Typography Scale
```tsx
// Page Titles - Friendly tone
<Text className="text-2xl font-bold text-text-main">오늘의 일기</Text>

// Card Titles
<Text className="text-lg font-semibold text-text-main">핵심 어휘</Text>

// Diary Content - Body text
<Text className="text-base font-normal text-text-main leading-relaxed">
  {diaryContent}
</Text>

// Japanese Text - With proper spacing
<Text className="text-xl font-medium text-text-main tracking-wide">
  {japaneseText}
</Text>

// Dates, Metadata
<Text className="text-sm text-text-sub">{date}</Text>

// Hints, Placeholders
<Text className="text-sm text-text-sub opacity-70">{hint}</Text>
```

