## Mood Emoji Styling

```tsx
const moods = ['😊', '😢', '😡', '😴', '🥳', '😌'];

<View className="flex-row gap-3">
  {moods.map((mood) => (
    <Pressable
      key={mood}
      className={cn(
        'w-12 h-12 rounded-full items-center justify-center',
        selected === mood 
          ? 'bg-brand-light border-2 border-brand' 
          : 'bg-bg-canvas'
      )}
    >
      <Text className="text-2xl">{mood}</Text>
    </Pressable>
  ))}
</View>
```

